{"id":"sesn_01BgACCAqNrWbNw5B4bhNgSE","email":"","name":"Nice","channel":"voice","source":"Phone call","readonly":true,"via":"HeliumDeploy's support inbox","assignee":"","created_at":"2026-09-30T02:17:27.937162Z","last_at":"2026-09-30T02:19:30.938321Z","status":"closed","mode":"bot","handed":false,"live":false,"lookups":0,"needs":false,"unread":false,"preview":"The bug match","page":"","count":11,"bought":[],"store":{"readonly":true,"preview":false,"inbox_all":true,"live_nudge":false,"shop":"heliumdeploy.myshopify.com","brand":"HeliumDeploy","agent":"Sarah","live":false,"owner":"The team","orders":true,"avatar":"/avatar.png"},"cost_cents":null,"cost_free":null,"shopify_customer":"","messages":[{"id":"0munh6e61-l043rc","at":"2026-09-30T02:17:34.009045Z","who":"tool","kind":"calc","text":"Ran the power-cost calculator · 16¢/kWh"},{"id":"0munh6gyu-l143rd","at":"2026-09-30T02:17:37.638506Z","who":"tool","kind":"note","text":"Looked up for Sarah: Magic Miner 40T at 16¢: stacks about 57,500 sats a month, roughly $48; power runs about $76 a month; block odds about 0.22% a year."},{"id":"0munh6prl-l243re","at":"2026-09-30T02:17:49.041879Z","who":"agent","text":"Hey, I'm Sarah! I know every miner we carry, and I'm here to help. Adding to your setup, nice. What are you running right now? If you want to answer out loud, tap the mic, or just listen."},{"id":"0munh6prl-l343rf","at":"2026-09-30T02:17:49.041879Z","who":"shopper","text":"Thirteen point eight terahash"},{"id":"0munh6rw3-l443rg","at":"2026-09-30T02:17:51.795940Z","who":"tool","kind":"note","text":"Looked up for Sarah: The 40T at 40 TH/s is nearly three times their 13.8, at 650 W — $799, batch 5 ships November 14."},{"id":"0munh7ay0-l543rh","at":"2026-09-30T02:18:16.488545Z","who":"agent","text":"Nice, so the 40T would add a big chunk on top of that. At around sixteen cents, it stacks about fifty-seven thousand sats a month, power's about seventy-six dollars a month, and block odds are about a fifth of a percent a year. Where would it sit?"},{"id":"0munh7ay0-l643ri","at":"2026-09-30T02:18:16.488545Z","who":"shopper","text":"Probably on my desk."},{"id":"0munh7cfq-l743rj","at":"2026-09-30T02:18:18.422177Z","who":"tool","kind":"web","text":"Read the magic miner 40t page"},{"id":"0munh7dzq-l843rk","at":"2026-09-30T02:18:20.438915Z","who":"tool","kind":"note","text":"Looked up for Sarah: Desk-friendly: ~50 dB in Eco, 33 x 16.5 x 19 cm, dual fan; Eco mode is 30 TH/s at 450 W, and it's live now as Batch 6, 50 units."},{"id":"0munh7fhz-l943rl","at":"2026-09-30T02:18:22.391211Z","who":"shopper","text":"When she was a girl, what was she thinking like?"},{"id":"0munh7hzs-l1043rm","at":"2026-09-30T02:18:25.624841Z","who":"shopper","text":"She was beautiful."},{"id":"0munh7k55-l1143rn","at":"2026-09-30T02:18:28.409983Z","who":"shopper","text":"She was a good baby."},{"id":"0munh7mhu-l1243ro","at":"2026-09-30T02:18:31.458608Z","who":"shopper","text":"On my desk?"},{"id":"0munh7st8-l1343rp","at":"2026-09-30T02:18:39.644246Z","who":"shopper","text":"Except those who were jealous. They were really, like, to run at home. But I was always waiting that time to then"},{"id":"0munh7vmw-l1443rq","at":"2026-09-30T02:18:43.304185Z","who":"shopper","text":"Okay?"},{"id":"0munh8we2-l1543rr","at":"2026-09-30T02:19:30.938321Z","who":"shopper","text":"The bug match"}],"context":{"page":"","link":"","viewed":[],"pop":"","opened_by":"","lookups":[],"handoffs":[]},"taken_at":null,"profile":null,"posthog_id":"","replays":[],"person_url":""}